Ladybird’s management.getSelf() returns the fields Firefox’s
getExtensionInfoForAddon() (ext-management.js) fills for the calling
extension, with installType “normal” for an archive install and
“development” for one loaded from a directory — as Firefox reports a
temporarily installed one. Chromium’s ManagementGetSelfFunction::Run()
returns the same ExtensionInfo shape. WebKit has no management API.
